    "extract": "Analogues is a 2023 Chilean science fiction drama film written, scored and directed by Jorge Olguín. Starring Mónica Carrasco and Jorge Gajardo accompanied by Cindy Díaz. It is about an elderly couple who feel alone while an immigrant comes into their lives and an astronomical phenomenon appears in the sky.",
    "extract_html": "<p><i><b>Analogues</b></i> is a 2023 Chilean science fiction drama film written, scored and directed by Jorge Olguín. Starring Mónica Carrasco and Jorge Gajardo accompanied by Cindy Díaz. It is about an elderly couple who feel alone while an immigrant comes into their lives and an astronomical phenomenon appears in the sky.</p>"
